11:48.990 --> 11:52.630
<b>In the first place, “common sense”
is nothing more than taking the...</b>

11:52.630 --> 11:55.330
<b>...lowest common denominator from
where you are at the time.</b>

11:55.960 --> 11:59.370
<b>My dad told me that once.</b>

11:59.370 --> 12:02.100
<b>Common sense isn’t always correct, and sometimes...</b>

12:02.100 --> 12:06.510
<b>...it inadvertently gets in the way and stops
one from being able to see the truth.</b>

12:06.510 --> 12:12.110
<b>That may be true, but in a scenario like this,
who cares about the “truth”?</b>

12:12.110 --> 12:15.350
<b>I do. I want to know it.</b>

12:15.350 --> 12:18.120
<b>That’s why I came here.</b>

12:18.120 --> 12:22.320
<b>I also want to stay here a little longer
and watch what happens.</b>

12:26.830 --> 12:27.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:29.100 --> 12:34.030
<b>I always knew you were really
a hard-headed girl, Kisa.</b>

12:34.040 --> 12:34.940
<b>Really?</b>

12:34.940 --> 12:36.700
<b>Yes, really!</b>

12:36.710 --> 12:39.610
<b>I give up. I’ll just stick with you for this.</b>

12:39.610 --> 12:41.680
<b>But promise me one thing.</b>

12:42.810 --> 12:46.050
<b>If we start thinking things are getting
really dangerous, we’ll run for it.</b>

12:46.050 --> 12:47.010
<b>Okay?</b>

12:47.020 --> 12:48.320
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:48.320 --> 12:51.390
<b>But it’d probably be too late at that point.</b>

12:51.390 --> 12:53.020
<b>Don’t say ominous things like that!</b>

13:15.680 --> 13:16.980
<b>Hey now.</b>

13:16.980 --> 13:19.010
<b>Sukawara... san.</b>

13:19.550 --> 13:22.050
<b>Umm... did you see my message?</b>

13:22.050 --> 13:23.720
<b>I saw it, which is why I’m here.</b>

13:30.530 --> 13:32.990
<b>Oh, yeah. Could you take out
your cell phone?</b>

13:32.990 --> 13:34.200
<b>What?</b>

13:36.630 --> 13:41.140
<b>I had some interesting data about the flashes, too...</b>

13:41.140 --> 13:43.100
<b>Data? What kind?</b>

13:43.640 --> 13:45.310
<b>Can you put this in yours?</b>

13:46.780 --> 13:49.240
<b>Ah... it’s different from the type I have.</b>

13:50.250 --> 13:52.150
<b>This is no good...</b>

13:52.150 --> 13:56.220
<b>I thought it’d make a good Christmas present, too.</b>

13:56.220 --> 13:57.950
<b>Oh! That makes me happy.</b>

13:57.950 --> 14:00.250
<b>But now I can’t.</b>

14:00.260 --> 14:05.030
<b>It’s all right. I’ll believe you,
so just tell me.</b>

14:05.030 --> 14:08.930
<b>The flashes that keep occurring... I’ve been counting them since about one o’clock.</b>

14:09.970 --> 14:11.870
<b>What was the term for it again...</b>

14:11.870 --> 14:13.600
<b>It’s like a geometric series.</b>

14:13.600 --> 14:15.370
<b>The flashes are increasing exponentially.</b>

14:15.370 --> 14:18.940
<b>In other words, the activity up there is increasing?</b>

14:20.380 --> 14:23.010
<b>This might be a sign that something’s
going to happen soon.</b>

14:23.010 --> 14:25.880
<b>Like... it’s going to move or something?</b>

14:30.650 --> 14:32.250
<b>You sure we can go this way?</b>

14:36.730 --> 14:40.160
<b>There really must be something wrong
with me if I’m trusting you.</b>

15:00.750 --> 15:01.650
<b>Hey, wait up!</b>

15:01.650 --> 15:04.520
<b>Bankoku Bridge</b>

15:05.820 --> 15:10.620
<b>Sukawara-san, I... umm...</b>

15:12.490 --> 15:14.300
<b>I’m listening.
What is it?</b>

15:14.300 --> 15:17.970
<b>I’m... glad I was able to meet you.</b>

15:17.970 --> 15:21.370
<b>Because I learned there was something
more fun than playing games.</b>

15:21.370 --> 15:24.810
<b>This is fun. I’m grateful to you for that.</b>

15:24.810 --> 15:31.780
<b>That’s why... I’d like to be together with you,
even if it’s not work-related.</b>

15:31.780 --> 15:34.850
<b>And? What about it?</b>

15:35.420 --> 15:40.190
<b>Umm... I just... confessed my feelings for you.</b>

15:50.200 --> 15:52.800
<b>I like you, Sukawara-san.</b>

15:56.100 --> 15:58.770
<b>Am I... no good?</b>

16:03.910 --> 16:06.210
<b>I have no interest in guys
younger than me.</b>

16:06.210 --> 16:08.580
<b>Don’t talk nonsense.
Let’s keep moving.</b>

16:11.590 --> 16:12.720
<b>As I thought...</b>

16:20.230 --> 16:21.960
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

16:21.960 --> 16:23.530
<b>What is it this time?</b>

16:23.530 --> 16:29.470
<b>I heard this from Kobayakawa, but it seems that
Tanigawa-san’s thing changed into a fairy.</b>

16:30.940 --> 16:32.210
<b>It changed?</b>

17:03.570 --> 17:06.370
<b>Dosshiru... Shisshin...</b>

17:06.370 --> 17:07.440
<b>Why are you two here?</b>

17:09.280 --> 17:10.880
<b>Shigeki!</b>

17:14.720 --> 17:18.420
<b>Sorry I’m late.
Did I make it in time?</b>

17:18.420 --> 17:20.390
<b>Right at the last second.</b>

17:20.390 --> 17:22.020
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

17:22.020 --> 17:24.330
<b>Just something between us.</b>

17:24.330 --> 17:26.360
<b>Riezo, thank you.</b>

17:30.070 --> 17:32.670
<b>Kisa, are you all right?</b>

17:32.670 --> 17:33.900
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:33.900 --> 17:37.470
<b>And... what’s the current situation?</b>

17:37.470 --> 17:39.540
<b>Where to begin?</b>

17:40.940 --> 17:44.480
<b>Umm... did I tell you about Pou-chan?</b>

17:44.480 --> 17:45.850
<b>Pou-chan?</b>

17:45.850 --> 17:48.280
<b>So... you gave it a name.</b>

17:48.280 --> 17:49.050
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:58.060 --> 17:59.390
<b>Stay in there.</b>

17:59.390 --> 18:01.300
<b>Hey.</b>

18:01.300 --> 18:02.860
<b>You can’t come out!</b>

18:05.030 --> 18:05.970
<b>Pou-chan!</b>

18:15.780 --> 18:18.350
<b>They look like they’re having fun.</b>

18:18.350 --> 18:19.250
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:41.470 --> 18:42.770
<b>What the...?</b>

18:56.250 --> 18:57.250
<b>Sukawara-san!</b>

18:58.250 --> 18:59.720
<b>Over there!</b>

19:10.400 --> 19:12.130
<b>This is the last dash of the race!</b>

19:13.240 --> 19:14.070
<b>Sukawara-san?!</b>

19:22.780 --> 19:24.350
<b>Dosshiru! Shisshin!</b>

19:24.350 --> 19:25.380
<b>Pou-chan!</b>

19:30.120 --> 19:31.220
<b>Let’s go after them, too!</b>

19:32.650 --> 19:33.950
<b>Kisa!</b>

19:33.960 --> 19:34.720
<b>Yeah...</b>

19:42.400 --> 19:45.200
<b>I’ll be with you guys to the very end.</b>

19:46.800 --> 19:48.400
<b>Rieko-chan!</b>

19:49.970 --> 19:52.210
<b>Rieko-chan, are you all right?!</b>

19:52.840 --> 19:54.910
<b>Makki...</b>

20:04.720 --> 20:05.950
<b>You’re late...</b>

20:05.950 --> 20:06.890
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

20:07.890 --> 20:09.020
<b>Where’d the lights go?!</b>

20:09.020 --> 20:10.220
<b>That way.</b>

20:17.430 --> 20:18.370
<b>Hey!</b>

20:32.710 --> 20:35.680
<b>Dosshiru... Shisshin...</b>

20:36.590 --> 20:37.720
<b>Pou-chan!</b>

20:55.570 --> 20:57.100
<b>Pou-chan!</b>

21:03.280 --> 21:04.450
<b>Run!</b>

21:23.430 --> 21:24.430
<b>Kisa...</b>

21:35.040 --> 21:38.950
<b>Does it look like it’s descending to you...?</b>

21:39.720 --> 21:43.480
<b>Hey... isn’t this getting really dangerous?</b>

21:45.920 --> 21:49.520
<b>Where would be safe?</b>

21:49.520 --> 21:55.300
<b>If it really is dangerous, no place in
the entire Kanto region is safe.</b>

21:56.770 --> 21:58.500
<b>This is one hell of an affair.</b>

21:59.470 --> 22:02.140
<b>After coming all this way,
are you going to miss the ending?</b>

22:06.680 --> 22:08.710
<b>Pou-chan was...</b>

22:08.710 --> 22:10.440
<b>Kisa.</b>

22:10.980 --> 22:13.710
<b>Pou-chan was... originally Bun-chan, and...</b>

22:15.650 --> 22:18.720
<b>...Bun-chan was destroyed by Pou-chan’s friends...</b>

22:20.460 --> 22:24.130
<b>...and now Pou-chan was destroyed
by Bun-chan’s friends...</b>

22:35.070 --> 22:41.010
<b>[Iwata Kindergarten]</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.980 --> 24:22.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.440 --> 24:22.110
<b>It sure is spring...</b>

24:22.110 --> 24:23.110
<b>Spring, huh?</b>

24:23.110 --> 24:24.410
<b>Spring it is...</b>

24:24.410 --> 24:26.750
<b>And when one brings up spring,
one always thinks of <i>that</i>...</b>

24:26.750 --> 24:27.680
<b><i>That</i> it is.</b>

24:27.680 --> 24:29.050
<b>It’s <i>that</i>, huh?</b>

24:29.050 --> 24:31.420
<b>But when you talk about <i>that</i>,
you’re really talking about *that*.</b>

24:31.420 --> 24:32.820
<b>Yeah. It sure is *that*.</b>

24:32.820 --> 24:34.160
<b>*That*, huh?</b>

24:34.160 --> 24:36.160
<b>And when you talk about *that*,
it’s obvious you’re talking about spring.</b>

24:36.160 --> 24:37.190
<b>Spring, huh?</b>

24:37.190 --> 24:38.330
<b>Spring indeed.</b>

24:38.330 --> 24:39.990
<b>In other words, spring.</b>

24:40.000 --> 24:41.100
<b>Yep, spring.</b>

24:41.100 --> 24:42.560
<b>Spring!</b>

24:42.560 --> 24:44.930
<b>And when one brings up spring,
one always thinks of <i>that</i>.</b>

24:44.930 --> 24:46.270
<b>So what is <i>that</i>?</b>

24:46.270 --> 24:47.230
<b>What is it?</b>

24:47.240 --> 24:50.000
<b>When you say spring, you’re obviously talking
about the season of separating with people.</b>

24:50.010 --> 24:51.340
<b>The season of separating with people?</b>

24:51.340 --> 24:52.510
<b>Separating?</b>

24:52.510 --> 24:56.110
<b>Next time, the final episode:
The End of a Forlorn and Plentiful Winter.</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>The End of a Forlorn and Plentiful Winter</b>

24:56.110 --> 24:57.510
<b>The final episode?!</b>
